Reviewer checklist
------------------
   Every async-looking endpoint in check_timing_intent is in one class above.
   No ordinary clk_sys logic appears only because of a broad false path.
   Held PD/counter bus is sampled only after STOP visibility and before pd_clear.
   Context-bank readout occurs only after capture commit and drain synchronization.
   Gray-counter async clears are covered by the teardown-ordering waiver.
   PD cell clock/data warnings are limited to intentional Vernier sampling.
